rev('transport-d', [('Yellow and all-red', "The yellow interval covers the driver's reaction time plus the time to decelerate. The all-red interval that follows lets a vehicle that entered legally on yellow clear the intersection. Reaction time is taken as 1.0 s at signals, against 2.5 s for stopping sight distance.")])
